# Full per-n operator archives (decoders for every n, ~86 MB) live on the local machine only:
# git keeps every version forever, and for a fixed encoder the decoder carries no extra
# information -- it is the solution of the recovery SDP.  anc/ ships the encoders for every n
# plus the n=17 decoders needed to check superactivation end to end.
local_data/

# scratch from long unattended runs
logs/
results/
